# fixedbugs, defect 2335, 2026-11-08: the shape padded, two fields and the
# first given again after the second. It was told the rule of naming every
# field, which it does; the third label is told instead, given twice.
record Pair
    a: i64
    b: i64

function main()
    p = Pair(a: 1, b: 2, a: 3)  #~ wrong_label
    print(p.a + p.b)
